6. Root-cause before any gold/null rerun. From the runs/gold-null2 logs, find task 39/52 and the two exit-124 tasks. Prime suspect: `timeout` kills only the direct child, so orphaned pytest or grandchild processes kept growing. Fix it in the sandbox runner. Each task gets its own process group or systemd-run scope with MemoryMax=4G and 2 CPUs, which also matches the scorer sandbox (4 GiB, 2 vCPU). On timeout, kill the whole group, and assert no survivors before the next task. Log peak RSS per task. Send it to codex-review and add a unit test that spawns an orphaning child.
